00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:41.180
Nanase Karin
(Haruko)

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.290
She didn't even try to criticize the media

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:41.180
that had driven her sister to suicide.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:44.310
Hatsumi sent the media that note to get

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.560
a bit of revenge against her sister.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:51.900
But what resulted from her sending the note 
probably far exceeded her expectations.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:53.950
That's why...

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:59.500
There's no way Haruko would die so easily...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.850
Isn't it possible she was 
killed by someone else?!

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:06.420
<i>Someone else?</i>

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:11.430
<i>This body must be... someone else's...</i>

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:16.430
She wondered if her sister had faked her 
death so she could get revenge on her.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:20.760
Realistically, switching out the bodies 
would've been a difficult feat.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.480
But it's also not impossible.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:29.020
To Hatsumi, it seemed very likely that 
her sister would do something like that.

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:32.480
She seemed to Hatsumi to 
be the type that would try

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:36.150
to get revenge if she found out that 
someone had put her through all that.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:39.330
<i>I'm probably going to be 
killed like that, too...</i>

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.940
<i>Haruko would totally do that.</i>

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:45.000
<i>No...</i>

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:47.500
No, no, no!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.040
Haruko is alive!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.650
Those who are presumed dead

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.960
are invincible avengers that 
no one would ever expect.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.500
Hatsumi was in fear.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.700
She was so terrified of the 
shadow of her younger sister,

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.740
who was actually dead, 
that it started affecting her daily life.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:19.990
So what she needed was a 
lie like Steel Lady Nanase.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.010
<i>Huh?</i>

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:21.990
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.140
Let's say there's someone who cares deeply

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:26.500
for Hatsumi and was trying to help her out.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:32.260
Haruko-chan died. Hatsumi needs to 
accept that, or she's going to break.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.630
This is the only way to help Hatsumi.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:39.970
I just have to prove that Haruko-chan's dead!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:43.890
<b>Me and My Flamethrower</b>

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:43.890
<b>Fiery Youth! The Girl Who Breathes Fire!</b>

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:43.890
