Karin's ghost appear!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.390
So then, I said...

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:49.980
He took on Steel Lady Nanase's form 
and started attacking people at night

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.890
What is that?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.790
to fake the existence of this ghost, 
and tried to spread rumors about it.

